Package: easyaiot-panel
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-v2 | docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose
Maintainer: EasyAIoT <easyaiot@local>
Homepage: https://github.com/soaring-xiongkulu/easyaiot
Description: EasyAIoT platform ops console (PANEL)
 Independent ops panel for EasyAIoT: Docker container management,
 __INSTALL_SCRIPT__ UI, topology and host overview.
 .
 Binary embeds the Vue UI and Flask agent (listens on :9200 by default).
 Set EASYAIOT_ROOT in /etc/easyaiot-panel/panel.env (default: /opt/easyaiot-panel/runtime).
